OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,7,     Gfrom Angels of Libra, delivering
OL,8,     Ga 30-minute mix steeped in deep
OL,9,     Gsoul, spiritual jazz and warm,
OL,10,     Gcosmic grooves.
OL,11,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,12,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,13,     Gcross time, space and genre.
OL,14,     GExpect key cuts by the likes of J
OL,15,     GDilla, Pampidoo, Lauryn Hill, The
OL,16,     GAggrovators and Earl Zinger.
OL,17,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,18,     GSHERELLE pays homage to the sound
OL,19,     Gof Detroit with a selection of
OL,20,     Gdeep, groovy house and techno.
